The '''2022 Brentwood Borough Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Brentwood Borough Council]] in England.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://document.brentwood.gov.uk/pdf/28032022101220000000.pdf |title=Notice of Election |access-date=6 May 2022 |work=Brentwood Borough Council}}</ref> This was on the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|local elections]].

